1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,601
Watch the currents flow.

2
00:00:01,601 --> 00:00:07,630
And check: A sits six volts above B, because three amps flow through two ohms.

3
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:13,919
The left cell has ten minus six, four volts, across its two ohms: two amps.

4
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:19,830
The right cell has nine minus six, three volts, across three ohms: one amp.

5
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:21,132
It all fits.

